      "sceneTitle": "Helmet",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wear it proudly",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wear it humbly",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Old, thin, willing.",
      "sceneTitle": "Rocinante",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pat his neck",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Spur him",
          "consequence": "Foolish.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "A neighbor agrees to be your squire for the promise of an island.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sancho",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Promise",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Confess no island exists",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "Giants on the plain. Wave their arms.",
      "sceneTitle": "Windmills",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Charge",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stop",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "You fall. Sancho lifts you.",
      "sceneTitle": "Bruise",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Insist they were giants",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Admit windmills",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "You request to be knighted by the innkeeper.",
      "sceneTitle": "Inn as Castle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Kneel",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay him first",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "You read them poetry. They are, mostly, polite.",
      "sceneTitle": "Goatherds",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Continue",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stop",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "You free them. They beat you and run.",
      "sceneTitle": "Galley Slaves",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Mourn",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Insist it was right",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "A madman in the mountains. He has a sad story.",
      "sceneTitle": "Cardenio",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Listen",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lecture",
          "consequence": "Foolish.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "She is, you decide, a princess. She is, in fact, a farm girl named Aldonza.",
      "sceneTitle": "Dulcinea",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Believe she's a princess",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Send her a letter signed your knight",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "A barber's basin. You insist.",
      "sceneTitle": "Helmet of Mambrino",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wear it",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Return it",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "He asks. You owe.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sancho's Wages",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pay him in promises",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay him real",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "They host you to mock you. You don't notice.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Duke and Duchess",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be a good guest",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Suspect",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "They give him a town to govern. He governs surprisingly well.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sancho's Island",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be proud",
          "consequence": "Friend.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be jealous",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "You go down. You report dreams.",
      "sceneTitle": "Cave of Montesinos",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tell them honestly",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Embellish",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "A neighbor in armor challenges you. If he wins, you go home.",
      "sceneTitle": "Knight of the White Moon",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Accept",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Decline",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "You lose. You ride home in your borrowed dignity.",
      "sceneTitle": "Defeat",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be silent",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Plan revenge",
          "consequence": "Foolish.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Bed. The priest. The barber. Sancho weeps.",
      "sceneTitle": "Fever",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Accept death",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Plan a shepherd's life",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "You renounce the books.",
      "sceneTitle": "Confession",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Mean it",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Half-mean it",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "You die. The village is quieter.",
      "sceneTitle": "Death",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Smile",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_books"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cry",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_sancho"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_quixote"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_books",
      "text": "Your library is burned, with the priest's careful selection. Some are saved. The village reads them, occasionally, with skepticism.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Books, Burned",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Books, Burned"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_sancho",
      "text": "Sancho tells your story to whoever stops at the inn. The story grows kinder as it travels. By a generation it is, in many ways, a kind of scripture.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sancho's Telling",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Sancho's Telling"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_quixote",
      "text": "An author named Cervantes hears the story. He writes it down. It outlives every kingdom you would have conquered. You become, against your will, a saint of imperfect courage.",
      "sceneTitle": "Quixote, Eternal",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Quixote, Eternal"
    }
  ]
}
